 ensate you with the sum of (USD$2.560. two million five hundred sixty dolla
 rs ) this compensation is also including international business that failed
  you in past due to government problems etc.\n\nWe have arranged your payme
 nt through our ATM MasterCard and deposited it in DHL Office to deliver it 
