DESCRIPTION:From Mr. Ahmed Ismail\nManager Bill and Exchange Dept\nBank of 
 Africa (BOA)\nOuagadougou\, Burkina Faso.\n\nMy Dear Friend\,\n\nI know tha
 t this mail will come to you as a surprise. I am the Bill and Exchange Mana
 ger in Bank of Africa .I Hope that you will not expose or betray this trust
  and confident that I am about to Repose on you for the mutual benefit of o
 ur both families.\n\nI need your urgent assistance in transferring the sum 
 of $10.7 million immediately to your account. The money has been dormant fo
 r years in our Bank here without any body coming for it.\n\nI want to relea
 se the money to you as the nearest person to our deceased customer because 
 the owner of the account died along with his supposed next of kin in an air
  Crash since July 2003.\n\nSo this is the reason why I contacted you\, so t
 hat the bank can release the money to the nearest person to deceased custom
 er. However\, if you can permit me I will use your information’s as the ben
 eficiary of the fund.\n\nIn our Banking law and guideline here stipulates t
 hat if such money remained unclaimed after Ten years an above\, the money w
 ill be transferred into the Bank treasury as unclaimed fund. The request of
  foreigner as next of kin in this business is occasioned by the fact that t
 he customer was a foreigner and a Real Burkina Person cannot stand as next 
 of kin to a foreigner.\n\nPlease I will like you to keep this proposal as a
  top secret and delete if you are not interested.\n\nUpon receipt of your r
 eply\, I will send you full details on how the Business will be executed an
 d also note that 40% of this money will be for you as foreign partner\, in 
 respect to the provision of a foreign account\, while 60% would be for me. 
 Acknowledge receipt of this message in acceptance of my mutual business End
 eavour by furnishing me with the following:\n\n(1) Your full name..........
 ......................\n(2) Your contact address......................\n(4)
  Your profession...............................\n(3) Your telephone and fax
  number.......\n\nI shall intimate you on what to do when I get your confir
 mation and acceptance.\n\nFor security purpose\, reply to me through this e
 mail address: mrahmedismail@voila.fr \n\nWaiting for your urgent response\n
 \nBest regards\,\n\nMr. Ahmed Ismail.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221206T182800Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:I AM WAITING FOR YOUR URGENT ASSISTANCE.
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
